
--> JUnit (JUnit 5)
    Theory
    Main testing framework in Spring Boot
    Uses annotations and assertions
    JUnit 5 = default


--> Key Annotations
    @Test          // test method
    @BeforeEach    // runs before each test
    @AfterEach     // cleanup
    @DisplayName   // readable test name
    @Tag("unit")   // grouping tests

--> @Test
    @DisplayName("Calculate total with valid inputs")
    void testCalculation() {
        assertEquals(200, 100 * 2);
    }




